"""
run_walking.py

Interactive simulation script to execute Unitree G1 standing and walking ONNX policies
using keyboard teleoperation (via pynput) inside a MuJoCo environment.

Usage Examples:
---------------
1. Run with keyboard teleoperation on the default plain table scene (spawns standing at Z=0.74m):
   python scripts/run_walking.py --scene scenes/mujoco/g1_world_scene.xml --teleop

2. Run in passive mode (robot stands then automatically walks forward at 0.8m/s after 2 seconds):
   python scripts/run_walking.py --scene scenes/mujoco/g1_world_scene.xml

3. Run in custom scene containing pathway/house geometries with spawn controls:
   python scripts/run_walking.py --scene path/to/custom_scene.xml --teleop --spawn house

Arguments:
----------
  --scene         (str)  : Path to the MuJoCo XML scene file (default: scenes/mujoco/g1_world_scene.xml)
  --teleop        (flag) : Enable keyboard teleoperation using Arrow keys and Q/E
  --spawn         (str)  : Spawn preference in custom environments containing pathway/house geoms. 
                           Choices: 'pathway' or 'house'. Defaults to flat ground level (Z=0.74m) if absent.
  --stand_policy  (str)  : Path to standing ONNX policy (default: model_policy/stand.onnx)
  --walk_policy   (str)  : Path to walking ONNX policy (default: model_policy/walk.onnx)
  --control_freq  (int)  : Policy execution update frequency in Hz (default: 50)

Controls (Teleop mode):
-----------------------
  UP Arrow   : Walk Forward (vx +)
  DOWN Arrow : Walk Backward (vx -)
  LEFT Arrow : Strafe Left (vy +)
  RIGHT Arrow: Strafe Right (vy -)
  Q / E      : Yaw Turn Left / Right (yaw rate)
  SPACE      : Stop and Stand Still (resets target velocity to 0)
  ESC / Close: Exit simulation cleanly
"""

